                  <td style="padding: 18px 24px; font-weight: bold; color: #16a34a;">&lt; 0.1%</td>
                  <td style="padding: 18px 24px;">400 Mbps - 550 Mbps</td>
                </tr>
                <tr style="background: #f8fafc;">
                  <td style="padding: 18px 24px;">🇺🇸 美国 US 家庭住宅原生组</td>
                  <td style="padding: 18px 24px;">130 ms - 145 ms</td>
                  <td style="padding: 18px 24px; font-weight: bold; color: #16a34a;">0.00%</td>
                  <td style="padding: 18px 24px;">350 Mbps - 500 Mbps</td>
                </tr>
